# kno adapter fixture v1
name: rate-limited
source: hand-authored from the documented error shape
note: a 429 with the provider's own window. core paces the retry from this rather than from our doubling backoff, whose whole budget is shorter than one real 429 window
status: 429
content-type: application/json
retry-after: 20

{
  "error": {
    "message": "Rate limit reached for gpt-5.6-luna in organization on requests per min (RPM): Limit 500, Used 500, Requested 1.",
    "type": "requests",
    "param": null,
    "code": "rate_limit_exceeded"
  }
}
